{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Discovery Flow\n\nBrowsing and searching for campsites, viewing details and photos.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -280,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "home-map",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "flows/discovery/01-home-map.png",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "home-map-event",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Events:**\n- `onMapMove`: Update visible campsites\n- `onMarkerTap`: Show campsite preview\n- `onSearch`: Open search screen\n- `onFilter`: Open filter modal\n- `onListView`: Switch to list view\n- `onLocationRequest`: Get user location",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "search",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "flows/discovery/02-search.png",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "search-event",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Events:**\n- `onSearchInput`: Filter results\n- `onFilterChange`: Apply filters\n- `onSort`: Change sort order\n- `onCampsiteSelect`: View details\n- `onFavorite`: Toggle saved\n- `onMapView`: Switch to map",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "campsite-detail-1",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "flows/discovery/03-campsite-detail-1.png",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "campsite-detail-1-event",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Events:**\n- `onImageTap`: Open photo gallery\n- `onFavorite`: Toggle saved\n- `onShare`: Share campsite\n- `onScroll`: Load more content\n- `onBookNow`: Start booking flow",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "campsite-detail-2",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "flows/discovery/04-campsite-detail-2.png",
      "x": 1350,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "campsite-detail-2-event",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Events:**\n- `onViewAllReviews`: See all reviews\n- `onSupplierTap`: View supplier\n- `onFacilityTap`: Show facility info\n- `onMapTap`: Open in maps app\n- `onCheckAvailability`: Select dates",
      "x": 1350,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "photo-gallery",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "flows/discovery/05-photo-gallery.png",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 500
    },
    {
      "id": "photo-gallery-event",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Events:**\n- `onSwipe`: Navigate photos\n- `onZoom`: Pinch to zoom\n- `onClose`: Return to detail\n- `onShare`: Share photo",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "booking-entry",
